within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.M_MusculoSkeletalSystem.M01A_AntiinflammatoryAndAntirheumaticProductsNonStero.M01AE02_Naproxen;
model Naproxen_Huntjens2006_PD_pge2
  "sigmoid_emax exposure-response sweep — Huntjens_2006 :: PGE2 (PGE2 inhibition (in vivo rat))"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep(
    E0 = 6.59e-05,      // [kg/m3; ng ml-1 × 1e-06]
    Emax = -2.68e-06,  // [kg/m3; ng ml-1 × 1e-06]
    EC50 = 0.002951,  // [kg/m3; ng ml-1 × 1e-06]
    gamma = 1.02,
    exposure_per_s = 1e-06);   // 1 ng ml-1 per second
  // imax_as_negative_emax: Imax (Q323) enters SigmoidEmaxSweep as −Emax
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 30000, Interval = 60),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>Naproxen_Huntjens2006_PD_pge2</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Huntjens DR et al., <i>British journal of pharmacology 148(4):396–404</i> 2006 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/sj.bjp.0706737\">doi:10.1038/sj.bjp.0706737</a>) — PGE2 inhibition (in vivo rat) [ng ml-1] against naproxen ng ml-1 — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: sigmoid_emax.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    =       65.9 ng ml-1  drug-free response (baseline) (I0, Q324)
  Emax  =       2.68 ng ml-1  maximal effect term (Imax y Intercept, Q323)
  EC50  =       2951 ng ml-1  exposure at half of the maximal effect term (IC50, Q322)
  gamma =       1.02          Hill coefficient (Hill coefficient, Q325)</pre><p>The algebra is <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep\">SigmoidEmaxSweep</a>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one ng ml-1 of naproxen per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 6.59e-05   (drug-free)
  exposure = EC50 (2951 ng ml-1)  response 6.456e-05
  exposure -> infinity  response 6.322e-05</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Huntjens_2006: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"));
end Naproxen_Huntjens2006_PD_pge2;
